---
import AppLayout from '../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---
<AppLayout title="Phishing inspector" category="Security / awareness" description="Slow the message down. Check its wording, sender, and link structure before deciding what to do next.">
<div class="workspace"><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Inspect a message</h2><label class="label" for="sender">Sender email</label><input id="sender" type="text" placeholder="name@example.com" maxlength="300"/><label class="label" for="subject">Subject</label><input id="subject" type="text" placeholder="What does the subject line say?" maxlength="500"/><label class="label" for="message">Message</label><textarea id="message" rows="8" maxlength="30000" placeholder="Paste the text here. Links are inspected, never opened."></textarea><div class="toolbar"><button id="inspect" class="button primary">Inspect message ↗</button><button id="sample" class="button">Try an example</button><button id="clear" class="minor-button">Clear</button></div><p class="panel-note">Analysis runs in your browser. Message content isn't sent to a server.</p></section><aside class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">PATTERN CHECK</span><p id="risk-number" class="result-number">—</p><span id="risk-label" class="pill">Ready to inspect</span><p id="summary" class="panel-note" aria-live="polite">Add a message to see which warning signs appear.</p><hr class="rule"/><div class="inspection-stats"><div><strong id="link-count">0</strong><span>Links</span></div><div><strong id="finding-count">0</strong><span>Signals</span></div><div><strong id="words">0</strong><span>Words</span></div></div><hr class="rule"/><p class="panel-note">The score counts weighted warning signs. It is not a probability or a safety verdict. A message with no detected signals can still be malicious.</p><button class="button" id="copy" disabled>Copy report</button><p id="copy-status" class="status-message" role="status"></p></aside></div><section class="panel evidence-panel"><h2 class="panel-title">What stands out</h2><div id="findings"><p class="empty-state">Your inspection notes will appear here, with the reason behind every signal.</p></div></section>
</AppLayout>
<script src="../../../scripts/phishing.js"></script>
<style>.inspection-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.inspection-stats strong{display:block;font-size:25px;font-weight:400}.inspection-stats span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-top:8px}.evidence-panel{margin-top:24px}:global(.finding){padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}:global(.finding h3){font-size:17px;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}:global(.finding h3 span){font:11px monospace;color:#ff9fae;white-space:nowrap}:global(.finding p){color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style>
